OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy and
OL,6,Foccasionally breezy day, especially
OL,7,Faround western coasts. There will be a
OL,8,Ffew brighter spells between scattered
OL,9,Fshowers. Ayrshire likely to have a
OL,10,Fdrier afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy with showers
OL,13,Fcontinuing through the evening, most
OL,14,Ffrequent for Argyll, a few clearer
OL,15,Fspells developing for Ayrshire.
OL,16,FShowers possibly turning heavy with
OL,17,Fthunder early on Wednesday morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
