OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA cloudy and damp start
OL,6,Fwith some heavy showers in the west,
OL,7,Fshowers tending to develop across the
OL,8,Farea with the risk of them becoming
OL,9,Fslow moving with some thunder.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FFresher conditions in northerly winds
OL,13,Fwith scattered showers at times on
OL,14,FThursday, a lot of brighter and sunny
OL,15,Fweather particularly towards the
OL,16,Fweekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
